SUMMARY:CDSS Data Discovery Fall Symposium
LOCATION:The Gateway
DESCRIPTION:The Data Discovery Symposium features poster presentations fro
 m student researchers. Working with mentors across campus and industry\, D
 ata Discovery participants use their data skills to design analyses\, buil
 d tools\, and present solutions to real world challenges. All are welcome 
 to join us for presentations\, networking\, and awards as we celebrate the
  students' work and contributions to the data research community. Time: 1:
 30 - 3:00 pm Awards will begin at 2:15 pm PST. Explore the CDSS Data Disco
 very Program: https://cdss.berkeley.edu/discovery
URL;VALUE=URI:https://events.berkeley.edu/live/events/332377-cdss-data-dis
 covery-fall-symposium
END:VEVENT
